  "label": "Stereotype of animals as affectionate or 'caring' companions",
  "description": "In popular culture and media, animals (especially dogs and cats) are often portrayed as loyal, loving, and emotionally supportive companions to humans. This stereotype is invoked here to contrast with the human social norm implied by 'sharing and caring', creating a humorous or ironic effect.",
